    "title": "What is Electrolysis?",
    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Electrolysis is the process of breaking down an ionic compound when molten by passing an electric current through it. This causes the compound to decompose into its individual elements.</p>",
